<p>All statements of fact in this post are based on records under IAM&#39;s direct control (ICANN WHOIS, Internet Archive captures, the July 2, 2026 Statement of Objection filing receipt) and on contemporaneous screenshots of publicly accessible Google product surfaces captured on July 4–5, 2026 and preserved as Exhibits A through E.</p>
